    "created_at": "2016-07-07T22:14:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-07T22:14:07Z",
    "body": "It looks like the bug is about HTMLTableElement, not HTMLTableSectionElement. HTMLTableSectionElement was fixed in #1105, but we seem to have overlooked HTMLTableElement.\n\nEdge passes those tests (so does not throw).\n\nI think we should align HTMLTableElement's deleteRow with HTMLTableSectionElement's and bail out early if there are no rows. Does that sound right?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
